WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:01:01.440 --> 00:01:06.840
It's a good idea to rest. It's time
to take responsibility for your actions.

00:01:06.920 --> 00:01:09.680
You're no different
to the gods that rule us.

00:01:10.640 --> 00:01:14.160
You created life
and left your children to their fate.

00:01:17.280 --> 00:01:19.320
Who made you judge?

00:01:33.960 --> 00:01:35.520
Who do you think you are?

00:01:52.120 --> 00:01:56.760
No! No, no, no... Oropo!

00:01:56.840 --> 00:01:58.520
Yugo!

00:01:58.600 --> 00:02:01.880
Yoo-hoo! Yugo!

00:02:05.800 --> 00:02:10.160
-Not you again.
-Still us. Always us, Yugo!

00:02:12.360 --> 00:02:14.320
You know we're part of you.

00:02:14.400 --> 00:02:16.520
There's no way to get rid of us.

00:02:21.040 --> 00:02:24.200
Why would you want him
to get rid of us, Qilby?

00:02:24.280 --> 00:02:28.480
-We're his best friends!
-Go away!

00:02:29.160 --> 00:02:30.720
Isn't that right, Yugo?

00:02:36.160 --> 00:02:38.240
Leave me alone!

00:04:46.400 --> 00:04:48.720
Yes! We are one!

00:04:49.320 --> 00:04:51.720
I wasn't expecting it to be this easy.

00:04:52.600 --> 00:04:56.360
Tell me it isn't true.
You haven't been lying all this time?

00:04:56.440 --> 00:04:59.000
Adamai, grow up already.

00:04:59.680 --> 00:05:03.320
I did manipulate you all a little,
but it was necessary.

00:05:03.800 --> 00:05:06.600
We'll change the rules
that govern the universe,

00:05:06.680 --> 00:05:08.880
I couldn't waste time convincing you.

00:05:08.960 --> 00:05:11.440
But you told me everything.

00:05:11.520 --> 00:05:14.520
Yes, there were a few of you
I could really count on.

00:05:15.080 --> 00:05:20.000
You have loved me sincerely for so long.
You've always supported me.

00:05:20.840 --> 00:05:23.560
I wish I could give you
what you've given me...

00:05:24.480 --> 00:05:27.360
But I can't give you what you want.

00:05:27.440 --> 00:05:32.240
Now that I'm whole again, I owe it
to myself to be honest with you

00:05:33.040 --> 00:05:35.800
I promise I won't lie to you anymore.

00:05:35.880 --> 00:05:39.840
Let me go! You're no better
than the other lunatics we've fought.

00:05:39.920 --> 00:05:43.400
Don't say that, Amalia,
I'm the one you love.

00:05:43.480 --> 00:05:44.880
I am Yugo.

00:05:46.120 --> 00:05:49.480
I should have seen it before.
You're nothing like Yugo.

00:05:49.560 --> 00:05:52.960
He doesn't lie or take advantage
of family and friends.

00:05:53.040 --> 00:05:55.840
You lied to Adamai to turn him against us.

00:05:55.920 --> 00:05:59.320
You played with your friends' feelings
to get what you want.

00:05:59.960 --> 00:06:04.560
It's true. What nasty trick did you play
on them? What did you promise them?

00:06:04.640 --> 00:06:08.360
You're not Yugo. No matter what you do,
you never will be.

00:06:08.440 --> 00:06:12.880
Amalia, you'll come to realize
that the work I do is for the good.

00:06:12.960 --> 00:06:16.320
You're all too young to understand
what I'm trying to do.

00:06:16.880 --> 00:06:19.000
You simply need to trust me.

00:06:21.560 --> 00:06:22.840
Trust you?

00:06:24.000 --> 00:06:26.560
Trust you? Really?

00:06:36.840 --> 00:06:38.000
Dame Echo, no!

00:06:42.480 --> 00:06:44.280
Stay back, girls.

00:06:47.360 --> 00:06:49.920
You're the only person I trusted.

00:06:50.000 --> 00:06:54.120
I followed you for centuries.
I believed in your cause.

00:06:54.800 --> 00:06:57.640
But the worst part is,
I thought you loved me...

00:07:01.800 --> 00:07:06.480
Like all your children here,
they all trusted you.

00:07:06.560 --> 00:07:08.560
They all believed you loved them,

00:07:08.640 --> 00:07:11.680
but, actually, you were just using us.

00:07:11.760 --> 00:07:13.440
No, Echo...

00:07:13.520 --> 00:07:15.400
Now I understand.

00:07:15.480 --> 00:07:19.200
We were never more to you
than a substitute family.

00:07:19.280 --> 00:07:22.080
You wanted to be in
the Brotherhood of the Tofu.

00:07:25.080 --> 00:07:28.480
You dreamt of being with her.
You're right, Princess Amalia.

00:07:28.560 --> 00:07:31.560
Oropo is a monster, a heartless freak.

00:07:31.640 --> 00:07:34.240
That's enough, Echo. You've gone too far.

00:07:41.240 --> 00:07:45.640
All of you... You...
You're not the first and you know it.

00:07:45.720 --> 00:07:50.040
Oropo has recruited
hundreds of demigods...

00:07:50.120 --> 00:07:54.400
and never hesitated to sacrifice them
for his cause.

00:07:55.760 --> 00:07:58.040
I said that was enough, Echo!

00:08:08.400 --> 00:08:11.280
-Have you forgotten how to obey?
-Do it, my love.

00:08:11.360 --> 00:08:13.200
Strike and release me already.

00:08:36.760 --> 00:08:40.800
Echo is right. I took advantage
of you all. That's a fact.

00:08:45.360 --> 00:08:50.160
What kind of supreme god would I be
if I couldn't face my own flaws?

00:08:50.240 --> 00:08:51.560
A supreme god?

00:08:53.760 --> 00:08:55.960
I think I've heard enough.

00:09:20.240 --> 00:09:25.160
Ah, Goultard. A good example
of the futility of the gods.

00:09:31.440 --> 00:09:32.880
All of you!

00:09:34.000 --> 00:09:36.200
I did it for your own good.

00:09:37.440 --> 00:09:39.840
To build a better world.

00:09:40.760 --> 00:09:43.960
You mean all this time, you were using us?

00:09:44.040 --> 00:09:45.800
You've treated us like trash.

00:09:45.880 --> 00:09:48.400
I know what you made me do, Oropo.

00:09:49.840 --> 00:09:52.520
You used me when I was lost.

00:10:02.720 --> 00:10:07.720
You made me use Ogrest,
so he'd unleash his sadness on the world.

00:10:07.800 --> 00:10:13.720
You... You're responsible for Ogrest's
chaos and the resulting deaths?

00:10:13.800 --> 00:10:15.760
A necessary evil.

00:10:15.840 --> 00:10:19.440
Just like you gave the Eliacube
to Noximilian the Clockmaker.

00:10:20.720 --> 00:10:23.400
&lt;i&gt;A necessary evil&lt;/i&gt;
&lt;i&gt;to weaken those ruling us.&lt;/i&gt;

00:10:37.280 --> 00:10:38.520
I can't believe it.

00:10:47.040 --> 00:10:50.600
I understand it's a lot for you all
to take in.

00:11:06.800 --> 00:11:08.240
You are a monster!

00:11:11.880 --> 00:11:12.920
Amalia, no!

00:11:25.720 --> 00:11:27.000
Amalia!

00:11:30.000 --> 00:11:33.560
&lt;i&gt;♪ Where is Yugo today&lt;/i&gt;
&lt;i&gt;Can he come out to play? ♪&lt;/i&gt;

00:11:33.640 --> 00:11:36.440
&lt;i&gt;♪ Where is Yugo today?&lt;/i&gt;
&lt;i&gt;Can he come out to play? ♪&lt;/i&gt;

00:11:41.600 --> 00:11:43.200
&lt;i&gt;♪ There he is ♪&lt;/i&gt;

00:11:45.080 --> 00:11:46.400
&lt;i&gt;♪ There he is ♪&lt;/i&gt;

00:11:47.600 --> 00:11:48.760
&lt;i&gt;♪ Run and play ♪&lt;/i&gt;

00:11:54.320 --> 00:11:56.680
I beat you once...

00:11:56.760 --> 00:11:58.800
I'll do it again.

00:12:33.000 --> 00:12:36.240
He's distracted.
Rubilax, can you hear what I'm thinking?

00:12:36.320 --> 00:12:40.440
There's usually nothing up there,
so even the smallest thought echoes.

00:12:40.520 --> 00:12:41.560
Okay, let's go!

00:12:59.320 --> 00:13:01.200
You're quite the fighter, Yugo.

00:13:18.680 --> 00:13:20.200
You hit your brother now?

00:13:21.000 --> 00:13:23.360
And them? Are you going to hit them, too?

00:13:26.320 --> 00:13:29.760
You were supposed to come to us.
Take care of us.

00:13:29.840 --> 00:13:33.440
-You were supposed to rule us.
-Find us a home.

00:13:34.000 --> 00:13:37.160
You didn't have time to look, right Yugo?

00:13:37.240 --> 00:13:40.040
I'll make it right. I promise!

00:13:40.120 --> 00:13:42.240
I... I wasn't ready.

00:13:42.320 --> 00:13:44.760
That should keep you quite busy.

00:13:50.880 --> 00:13:52.880
It will all be over very soon.

00:13:53.680 --> 00:13:55.720
When the Eliacube is ready...

00:13:56.640 --> 00:13:58.720
I'll send it into Ingloriom.

00:13:59.480 --> 00:14:01.600
That will be the end of the gods.

00:14:09.640 --> 00:14:12.880
I am a fool!
How could I have been so stupid?

00:14:12.960 --> 00:14:15.600
And when that's done, you'll join me.

00:14:22.320 --> 00:14:24.520
The first Dofus has been absorbed.

00:14:24.600 --> 00:14:26.360
It will go very quickly now.

00:14:43.520 --> 00:14:45.160
Here we go, finally.

00:14:45.240 --> 00:14:47.360
What made you change your mind?

00:14:47.440 --> 00:14:50.920
Oropo activated the Hyperzaap.
It's time to join the others.

00:14:55.320 --> 00:14:58.000
Arpagone, darling...

00:15:02.040 --> 00:15:04.760
I know I wasn't always
a good husband, but...

00:15:07.800 --> 00:15:10.520
You should know I've always loved you.

00:15:25.080 --> 00:15:26.600
Things are heating up.

00:15:27.400 --> 00:15:31.360
Can I help Papa? Pretty please?
Say yes! Please, please, please!

00:15:31.440 --> 00:15:34.960
We'll go together.
Your father's having all the fun!

00:15:35.040 --> 00:15:38.400
In your condition? With the baby?
That's a bad idea, Eva.

00:15:38.480 --> 00:15:41.840
We've been away from Dally for too long.
We must help him.

00:15:41.920 --> 00:15:44.600
Anyway, I don't think
we're safe here anymore.

00:15:45.720 --> 00:15:46.600
Exactly!

00:15:47.160 --> 00:15:48.920
What a family of tough guys.

00:15:49.520 --> 00:15:52.400
You're jealous
there's more Iop than Cra in it.

00:15:52.960 --> 00:15:57.360
And he hits hard! Let's get going!

00:15:59.120 --> 00:16:02.920
&lt;i&gt;I need you to keep them away.&lt;/i&gt;
&lt;i&gt;I still have to finish off Dally.&lt;/i&gt;

00:16:03.000 --> 00:16:05.560
&lt;i&gt;There's no point&lt;/i&gt;
&lt;i&gt;in making them watch that.&lt;/i&gt;

00:16:05.640 --> 00:16:09.760
&lt;i&gt;And if you use force,&lt;/i&gt;
&lt;i&gt;be careful not to hurt the baby.&lt;/i&gt;

00:16:10.320 --> 00:16:14.040
&lt;i&gt;If I can't convince Flopin and Elely&lt;/i&gt;
&lt;i&gt;to join us,&lt;/i&gt;

00:16:14.120 --> 00:16:17.480
&lt;i&gt;I can always raise him&lt;/i&gt;
&lt;i&gt;to meet our needs perfectly.&lt;/i&gt;

00:16:21.280 --> 00:16:24.920
Don't worry, Amalia. It'll be fine.
We've seen worse.

00:16:25.000 --> 00:16:26.800
No, you don't understand.

00:16:26.880 --> 00:16:29.000
I really can't let you guys out.

00:16:29.080 --> 00:16:30.880
It's much too dangerous!

00:16:36.120 --> 00:16:39.720
I'm sorry. I was just following orders
given to me.

00:16:48.680 --> 00:16:49.680
Sipho!

00:16:54.600 --> 00:16:56.400
You've got two seconds to...

00:16:56.480 --> 00:16:58.320
Give our baby brother back!

00:17:04.520 --> 00:17:06.280
You make a cute couple.

00:17:06.360 --> 00:17:07.840
Shut up, Rubi!

00:17:07.920 --> 00:17:10.040
Don't you see we need encouragement?

00:17:10.120 --> 00:17:14.840
Nonsense! You're only good when
the going's tough. You're lousy otherwise.

00:17:14.920 --> 00:17:16.160
He's got a point.

00:17:16.240 --> 00:17:19.360
The two of you together
are half as clever as me.

00:17:23.040 --> 00:17:25.160
It's not that complicated.

00:17:25.240 --> 00:17:27.360
You add your smarts to mine.

00:17:27.440 --> 00:17:31.560
Then divide that by two,
carry the three and... I'll start over!

00:17:31.640 --> 00:17:35.080
Never mind. Math's not your strong suit.

00:17:35.160 --> 00:17:37.400
Get that nut-job and make him suffer.

00:17:38.480 --> 00:17:41.640
You trained your Shushu well.
He speaks Iop good now.

00:17:41.720 --> 00:17:44.640
-It took long enough.
-Less talking, more action!

00:17:48.680 --> 00:17:51.440
So, Dally, how about this?

00:17:51.520 --> 00:17:54.360
I take care of Oropo
and you free the others?

00:17:55.040 --> 00:17:56.280
I have a better idea.

00:17:59.680 --> 00:18:01.320
I really fell for that.

00:18:03.120 --> 00:18:05.920
Brother... I am so sorry.

00:18:07.000 --> 00:18:10.280
Me, too, Yugo.
Sorry that you never keep your promises.

00:18:13.760 --> 00:18:16.760
How long do you want me
to wait for you, Yugo?

00:18:16.840 --> 00:18:20.800
The years are slipping away.
You have an eternity to decide.

00:18:25.640 --> 00:18:29.280
I'm sorry, Amalia.

00:18:45.160 --> 00:18:47.640
Dally, stop, I am your friend.

00:18:47.720 --> 00:18:49.200
My friend is Yugo!

00:18:49.280 --> 00:18:52.160
You're just another nut-job in our way.

00:19:03.000 --> 00:19:05.640
When we're done with you, we'll move on!

00:19:18.160 --> 00:19:21.960
But I am Yugo, you idiot!
Can't any of you understand that?

00:19:22.040 --> 00:19:26.240
Well, you know, I am an Iop.
We're not so good at understanding.

00:20:04.600 --> 00:20:07.200
From this point on,
I will destroy anyone...

00:20:12.640 --> 00:20:14.120
...who doesn't accept me.

00:20:15.480 --> 00:20:16.600
Dally!

00:20:38.120 --> 00:20:39.640
Still there, Yugo?

00:20:42.880 --> 00:20:46.800
Why are you still fighting,
lost in the depths of my mind?

00:20:47.440 --> 00:20:50.560
Stop struggling. Become part of me.

00:20:50.640 --> 00:20:54.560
-It would be so much easier.
-I'm not going to let myself die.

00:20:57.920 --> 00:20:59.240
Die?

00:20:59.800 --> 00:21:03.720
You know you cannot die.
You come back to life all the time.

00:21:03.800 --> 00:21:08.960
Not to mention the dragon blood in
your veins that makes you age very slowly.

00:21:09.840 --> 00:21:14.480
Aren't you tired of all that?
Don't you want to pass the baton?

00:21:14.560 --> 00:21:17.960
I am you, Yugo,
and I know what you've been going through.

00:21:18.520 --> 00:21:21.680
More than anyone, I know the weight
on your shoulders.

00:21:23.680 --> 00:21:25.640
Let me govern the Eliatropes.

00:21:28.360 --> 00:21:31.160
Let me help the world, Yugo.

00:21:32.960 --> 00:21:35.880
I can't believe that I'd ever...

00:21:37.360 --> 00:21:38.840
...be like you!

00:21:41.080 --> 00:21:44.680
Think, Yugo, before it's too late.

00:21:48.480 --> 00:21:52.040
There's no way I'd ever be like you!

